## Run it locally
1) Create the project folder and add files as above  
2) Install deps:
```bash
npm install
```
3) Create `.env.local` from `.env.local.example` and add your API key:
```bash
cp .env.local.example .env.local
# then edit .env.local
```
4) Start:
```bash
npm run dev
```
Open `http://localhost:3000`

